## Third-Party Open Source Notices

This product bundles open-source dependencies under their respective licenses.
The list below covers direct dependencies declared in `package.json` as of
release 1.0.0. Each entry links to the upstream project for the full license text.

### Application runtime
- Next.js (`next`, MIT) — https://github.com/vercel/next.js
- React & React DOM (`react`, `react-dom`, MIT) — https://github.com/facebook/react
- Redux Toolkit & React Redux (`@reduxjs/toolkit`, `react-redux`, MIT) — https://github.com/reduxjs/redux-toolkit
- Zod (`zod`, MIT) — https://github.com/colinhacks/zod
- React Hook Form & Resolvers (`react-hook-form`, `@hookform/resolvers`, MIT) — https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form
- TanStack Table (`@tanstack/react-table`, MIT) — https://github.com/TanStack/table
- Chart.js & React bindings (`chart.js`, `react-chartjs-2`, MIT) — https://github.com/chartjs/Chart.js
- Tailwind CSS plugins (`tailwindcss`, `@tailwindcss/forms`, `@tailwindcss/postcss`, `tailwindcss-animate`, MIT) — https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss
- next-themes (`next-themes`, MIT) — https://github.com/pacocoursey/next-themes
- Lucide icons (`lucide-react`, ISC) — https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
- Heroicons (`@heroicons/react`, MIT) — https://github.com/tailwindlabs/heroicons
- Sonner toast library (`sonner`, MIT) — https://github.com/emilkowalski/sonner
- Date-fns (`date-fns`, MIT) — https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns
- MSW browser mocks (`msw`, MIT) — https://github.com/mswjs/msw
- Undici (`undici`, MIT) — https://github.com/nodejs/undici

### Tooling & testing
- TypeScript (`typescript`, Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript
- ESLint & configs (`eslint`, `eslint-config-next`, `eslint-config-prettier`, MIT) — https://github.com/eslint/eslint
- Prettier (`prettier`, MIT) — https://github.com/prettier/prettier
- Jest & environment (`jest`, `jest-environment-jsdom`, MIT) — https://github.com/jestjs/jest
- Testing Library (`@testing-library/react`, `@testing-library/jest-dom`, `@testing-library/user-event`, MIT) — https://github.com/testing-library
- Tailwind CSS PostCSS stack (`postcss`, MIT) — https://github.com/postcss/postcss
- Type definitions (`@types/*`, MIT) — https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped

For transitive dependencies, consult the generated `package-lock.json`. All
third-party software is provided "as is" by its respective authors.
